---
// ArticleIntro — the visibly larger opening paragraph (Wes McDowell
// technique). Larger than body copy, smaller than an H2, never bold
// throughout, never boxed. Exactly one per article, immediately after
// the hero — the article returns to standard typography right after.
//
// Usage: <ArticleIntro>Opening paragraph text.</ArticleIntro>
---

<p class="fm-intro"><slot /></p>
